{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901035690010","name":"冬優子","text":"……何？　これ……","trans":"……什么？　这个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いい油だ！","trans":"这油不错！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035690020","name":"冬優子","text":"いい油……","trans":"不错的油……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"健康に気を遣ってる人はいい油を摂ってるって聞いて\r\n冬優子にもいいんじゃないかなって","trans":"听说注重健康的人都会摄取好油\n我想着对冬优子应该也不错","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……あれ……\r\nイマイチか……！？","trans":"……咦……\n不太行吗……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035690030","name":"冬優子","text":"別に？　そんなことないわよ？\r\nただ……持って帰るの重いなぁって","trans":"没什么？　也没那回事哦？\n只是……拿回去好重啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────あ！！","trans":"────啊！！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}